<view class="page coupon-page"><view class="eyebrow">MY COUPONS</view><view class="heading">我的购书优惠券</view><view wx:for="{{coupons}}" wx:key="index" class="card coupon"><view class="amount">¥{{item.amount}}</view><view class="info"><view>购书券 · 满 ¥{{item.minimum}} 可用</view><text>有效期至 {{item.date}}</text></view><view class="status">{{item.status}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!coupons.length}}" class="card empty"><view class="section-title">还没有优惠券</view><view class="subheading">邀请好友首次登录后，双方各得一张。</view></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="invite">邀请好友</button><view class="footer-note">本页优惠券仅用于前端购买演示，不产生真实交易。</view></view>
